2","author":"Arcane#7800","displayName":"Arcane","content":"@Fairy Angelic"},{"messageId":"chatlog__message-container-1324958888914718792","author":"truebornsnow","displayName":"loralie 🤠🖕🏻","content":"Wassup"},{"messageId":"chatlog__message-container-1324959036428259420","author":"fairyteacup","displayName":"Fairy Angelic","content":"Debating on sleep"},{"messageId":"chatlog__message-container-1324959076676796537","author":"fairyteacup","displayName":"Fairy Angelic","content":"How are you?"},{"messageId":"chatlog__message-container-1324959117084983369","author":"truebornsnow","displayName":"loralie 🤠🖕🏻","content":"Real"},{"messageId":"chatlog__message-container-1324959162957828158","author":"truebornsnow","displayName":"loralie 🤠🖕🏻","content":"I’m doing okay"},{"messageId":"chatlog__message-container-1324959181727465512","author":"truebornsnow","displayName":"loralie 🤠🖕🏻","content":"How are you?"},{"messageId":"chatlog__message-container-1324959283271565424","author":"fairyteacup","displayName":"Fairy Angelic","content":"It&#39;s 11;34 pm here.\n\nI&#39;m good."},{"messageId":"chatlog__message-container-1324959474284232837","author":"fairyteacup","displayName":"Fairy Angelic","content":"Today is the only day a week I can stay up, but at the same time I don&#39;t want to mess up my sleep cycle"},{"messageId":"chatlog__message-container-1324959814153146460","author":"truebornsnow","displayName":"loralie 🤠🖕🏻","content":"I totally understand that lol. I want to stay up, but I need to get back on a good sleep schedule. Last night I went to sleep at like 3:30, night before was 3:45, and the night before that was like 5:00"},{"messageId":"chatlog__message-container-1324960048975446076","author":"fairyteacup","displayName":"Fairy Angelic","content":"Ya I need 8-10 hours of sleep to function"},{"messageId":"chatlog__message-container-1324960158073356340","author":"fairyteacup","displayName":"Fairy Angelic","content":"Weekends I get 10-12"},{"messageId":"chatlog__message-con